/E (discipline of the limbs, and aspires to purification of the heart. The journey is gradual, and sincerity in striving is itself a sign of acceptance. The believer who enters Ramadan aware of these levels approaches fasting not as a burden but as a ladder, one that elevates him from heedlessness toward presence, from impulse toward intention, and from habit toward consciousness.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
