387 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 193 0 R
/E (Ramadan is not merely a season of multiplied reward; it is a season of diagnosis, a time in which the illnesses of the heart that remain concealed beneath layers of comfort and routine are brought into visibility so that they may be treated with sincerity and resolve. The scholars of purification consistently reminded the believers that the outward corruption of action is but a reflection of inward imbalance, and that unless the diseases of the heart are recognized and addressed, acts of worship risk remaining superficial.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
