<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 197 0 R
/E (The early scholars would fear for six months after Ramadan whether their fasting and prayers had been accepted, and then they would prepare for the next Ramadan during the remaining six months. This outlook not only reflects humility, but embodies sincerity, for acceptance was never presumed.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
